OL,3,AAI minister warns 'likely' UK's cyber
OL,4,Adefences will be breached
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's AI minister has warned it is
OL,7,F"likely, if not inevitable" the
OL,8,Fcountry's cyber defences will at some
OL,9,Fpoint be breached.
OL,11,FSpeaking at a press conference,
OL,12,FKanishka Narayan pointed to an incident
OL,13,Fof a rogue OpenAI agent hacking an
OL,14,FAustralian government website in June.
OL,16,FHe said while no medical records are
OL,17,Fknown to have been accessed in the
OL,18,Fattack, the incident should still
OL,19,F"concern us".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11904
SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791815051
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAI minister warns 'likely' UK's cyber
OL,4,Adefences will be breached
OL,5,
OL,6,FNarayan said the government plans to
OL,7,Fput advanced AI to work to combat the
OL,8,Fthreat, as he set out how the
OL,9,Fgovernment plans to prepare for any
OL,10,Fserious future incidents.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
