CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791815051
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAI is less regulated than milk, says
OL,4,AMicrosoft president
OL,5,
OL,6,FMilk and washing machines are currently
OL,7,Fmore regulated than AI, the president
OL,8,Fof Microsoft has said.
OL,10,FBrad Smith said there needed to be
OL,11,Fglobal safety rules in place, including
OL,12,Fa legal obligation to tell a "victim"
OL,13,Fif their system is breached by a rogue
OL,14,FAI agent as well as deciding when
OL,15,Foutside evaluators should sign off on
OL,16,Fan AI product before it is released.
OL,18,FHis comments put him at odds with
OL,19,FPresident Donald Trump, who said the
OL,20,Fsector should regulate itself so US
OL,21,Ffirms don't lose out to Chinese rivals.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11906
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791815051
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAI is less regulated than milk, says
OL,4,AMicrosoft president
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Smith said: "Right now, your
OL,7,Fwashing machine is subject to more
OL,8,Fsafety rules than AI. Every carton of
OL,9,Fmilk that you see in the grocery store
OL,10,Fis subject to safety rules and
OL,11,Finspection."
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
