OL,3,ATom Cruise film Digger forecast to
OL,4,Abecome one of Hollywood's biggest flops
OL,5,
OL,6,FTom Cruise's latest film Digger is
OL,7,Fexpected to lose around $245m (#185m),
OL,8,FHollywood analysts have said, after the
OL,9,Ffilm's continuing poor performance at
OL,10,Fthe box office.
OL,12,FTicket sales for the satirical black
OL,13,Fcomedy, which stars Cruise as oil
OL,14,Fmagnate Digger Rockwell, dropped by
OL,15,Faround 60% in the movie's second
OL,16,Fweekend in cinemas.
OL,18,FIt brings Digger's total box office
OL,19,Ftakings so far to around $35m (#26m)
OL,20,Fglobally. The film is estimated to have
OL,21,Fcost its studio Warner Bros around
OL,22,F$280m (#211m) to make and market.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791815051
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATom Cruise film Digger forecast to
OL,4,Abecome one of Hollywood's biggest flops
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Cruise said last week that he
OL,7,F"never thought of movies when I'm
OL,8,Fmaking them [in terms of] opening
OL,9,Fweekend," adding he was instead focused
OL,10,Fon making films that "hopefully will
OL,11,Ftranslate, last and evolve".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
