OL,3,ASacha Baron Cohen to star in Quentin
OL,4,ATarantino's West End play
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe director, best known for violent
OL,7,Ffilm classics Pulp Fiction and
OL,8,FReservoir Dogs, has said he is "keen
OL,9,Fwith anticipation to give the West End
OL,10,Fa great night out".
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
